      "doctor_question": "Hello, welcome. What brings you into the clinic today?",
      "targeted_symptom": "S011",
      "patient_response": "Well, um, what brought me in is that I keep leaving my station at work. Like, I'll just pop up during meetings when I'm supposed to stay put, and my supervisor says it's becoming a safety problem because I just take off before I even think about it. Speaking of my supervisor, she has this really annoying habit of clicking her pen during those meetings. It’s like, click, click, click, the whole time. I don't know how anyone else focuses with that going on. Anyway, I think she got that pen from a conference in Vegas. I went to Vegas once, but it was so hot I barely left the hotel. They had this amazing buffet though... oh, wait, what was I saying? Right, the safety problem. Yeah, I just can't seem to stay in my seat.",
